WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:57.089
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:57.359 --> 01:58.680
Got time to come with me?

3
02:01.959 --> 02:02.840
Someone wants to see you.

4
02:05.159 --> 02:07.040
Captain Bai, who are we meeting?

5
02:07.439 --> 02:08.680
I've got a ton on my plate.

6
02:08.680 --> 02:10.039
I don't have time to wander around here.

7
02:10.800 --> 02:11.840
You'll know soon enough.

8
02:22.400 --> 02:23.159
Zhang Junyan.

9
02:26.000 --> 02:26.719
Actually, I know

10
02:26.759 --> 02:28.599
you've always had so much to say to him.

11
02:29.639 --> 02:31.520
Lu Wei, there are many things

12
02:32.080 --> 02:33.479
we just have to face.

13
02:34.159 --> 02:34.560
Right?

14
02:36.759 --> 02:37.840
Have a good talk with him.

15
02:41.280 --> 02:41.759
Okay.

16
03:18.599 --> 03:19.439
Sorry about this.

17
03:19.800 --> 03:21.240
I can't stand up to welcome you.

18
03:25.599 --> 03:26.000
What?

19
03:27.120 --> 03:28.039
Just because I can't stand,

20
03:28.599 --> 03:30.199
you can't come over and sit down yourself?

21
03:37.039 --> 03:38.800
Captain Bai originally wanted me to go see you,

22
03:39.520 --> 03:41.199
but I don't really like your place.

23
03:42.400 --> 03:43.479
So I asked her

24
03:44.319 --> 03:45.599
to bring you here to see me.

25
03:48.120 --> 03:49.000
Actually,

26
03:49.639 --> 03:51.120
I should've come to see you a long time ago.

27
03:53.120 --> 03:54.479
It's not like you haven't visited.

28
03:56.000 --> 03:58.680
You just didn't dare let me see you.

29
04:00.400 --> 04:01.400
My legs may be crippled,

30
04:01.719 --> 04:02.840
but I'm not blind.

31
04:08.120 --> 04:08.840
I'm so sorry.

32
04:10.400 --> 04:11.000
Back then...

33
04:11.439 --> 04:12.879
What happened back then is long in the past.

34
04:19.160 --> 04:20.959
Did you really never resent me at all?

35
04:23.240 --> 04:24.040
Of course I did.

36
04:24.279 --> 04:25.720
For the first few years, I really hated you.

37
04:28.800 --> 04:29.600
Honestly,

38
04:29.800 --> 04:33.240
both of us were victims of that accident.

39
04:33.759 --> 04:34.800
I chose resentment,

40
04:36.560 --> 04:37.720
while you chose guilt.

41
04:43.000 --> 04:44.040
Sometimes when I think about it,

42
04:46.680 --> 04:47.839
we made our lives so exhausting.

43
04:51.600 --> 04:53.920
But these past few years, I've completely let it go.

44
04:54.839 --> 04:55.800
Look at me now.

45
04:57.319 --> 04:59.319
Playing chess in the park every day,

46
04:59.680 --> 05:00.480
taking in the scenery,

47
05:01.120 --> 05:02.160
and enjoying life.

48
05:02.600 --> 05:03.439
Isn't this pretty nice?

49
05:17.000 --> 05:17.560
Oh, right.

50
05:19.600 --> 05:20.279
I almost forgot.

51
05:20.800 --> 05:23.560
My daughter wanted me to pass along three words:

52
05:24.079 --> 05:24.560
"Thank you."

53
05:27.879 --> 05:29.120
The one who funded my daughter through college,

54
05:29.120 --> 05:30.319
that "Uncle Silly Bear,"

55
05:31.399 --> 05:32.000
it was you, right?

56
05:35.399 --> 05:36.040
"Silly Bear."

57
05:37.560 --> 05:38.959
Why pick such an awful name?

58
05:42.240 --> 05:44.879
Still, it actually suits your vibe pretty well.

59
05:49.279 --> 05:51.079
All right, I'm heading home.

60
05:52.279 --> 05:53.079
Let me see you out, then.

61
05:53.079 --> 05:54.839
No need. I don't live far.

62
05:57.360 --> 05:58.120
But...

63
06:01.319 --> 06:02.800
you still have a long road ahead of you.

64
06:04.399 --> 06:05.439
Remember to take it easy.

65
06:11.399 --> 06:11.800
Goodbye.

66
06:23.319 --> 06:24.639
If it wasn't for you last night,

67
06:25.360 --> 06:27.079
Brother Biao and I probably would've been done for.

68
06:28.920 --> 06:29.920
Do you have any idea

69
06:30.040 --> 06:31.879
what Brother Biao wants with us today?

70
06:32.519 --> 06:33.399
How should I know?

71
06:33.920 --> 06:35.839
Brother Biao's been acting so secretive lately.

72
06:38.240 --> 06:39.000
Open that up.

73
06:46.439 --> 06:47.279
Brother Biao wants you to take it.

74
06:47.800 --> 06:49.439
He said it might come in handy later.

75
07:02.319 --> 07:03.839
Hello. Thanks for your hard work, everyone.

76
07:05.240 --> 07:05.920
This is Captain Cheng.

77
07:05.959 --> 07:06.519
Officer Zhuang.

78
07:06.680 --> 07:07.000
Hello.

79
07:07.000 --> 07:07.480
Thanks for coming.

80
07:07.920 --> 07:08.399
Must've been a long trip.

81
07:13.560 --> 07:14.879
That guy over there seems a bit suspicious.

82
07:19.439 --> 07:20.720
I just saw him on the train.

83
07:20.920 --> 07:22.199
He said he used to be in the military.

84
07:23.000 --> 07:24.199
But he didn't really seem like one.

85
07:27.120 --> 07:27.920
Should we tail him?

86
07:28.639 --> 07:29.279
Forget it.

87
07:29.839 --> 07:31.000
We've got plenty of work to do.

88
07:31.920 --> 07:32.360
Let's go.

89
07:45.360 --> 07:48.040
Brother Guang, that kid didn't tell the boss the truth.

90
07:48.600 --> 07:49.519
We looked into it for two days

91
07:49.879 --> 07:51.040
before we finally found his wife's address.

92
07:52.680 --> 07:54.040
I called you earlier, but it didn't go through.

93
07:54.839 --> 07:57.160
Probably had no signal in the car.

94
07:57.759 --> 08:00.040
By the way, Xiao Feng is still waiting for word from us.

95
08:00.360 --> 08:02.199
Should we give Xiao Feng a call first?

96
08:05.759 --> 08:06.199
No need.

97
08:07.319 --> 08:08.160
Let's just head straight over to him.

98
08:08.680 --> 08:08.959
All right.

99
08:13.759 --> 08:16.680
Here is the suspect information provided by the police:

100
08:17.199 --> 08:18.680
Li Qiang, male, 35 years old,

101
08:18.920 --> 08:19.920
182 centimeters tall,

102
08:20.160 --> 08:21.560
armed with a firearm.

103
08:21.800 --> 08:24.160
If any citizens spot the suspect,

104
08:24.399 --> 08:25.920
please notify the police immediately.

105
08:26.240 --> 08:27.079
Turn it off, turn it off.

106
08:30.319 --> 08:33.159
Bro, who are we going to see this time?

107
08:33.519 --> 08:36.159
The guy just wanted on the radio.

108
08:37.240 --> 08:37.879
Li Qiang.

109
08:39.840 --> 08:40.679
Why, you know him?

110
08:41.679 --> 08:42.879
In the news lately,

111
08:43.399 --> 08:44.399
he pops up all the time.

112
08:44.799 --> 08:45.879
Didn't he cause us trouble before?

113
08:46.120 --> 08:47.080
Why are we meeting him then?

114
08:47.639 --> 08:50.159
He lost a fortune recently,

115
08:50.840 --> 08:52.440
and now he's wanted by the cops.

116
08:52.480 --> 08:54.440
He's practically a stray dog now.

117
08:55.159 --> 08:56.480
The reason he reached out to us

118
08:56.639 --> 08:58.960
is to help him offload a shipment.

119
08:59.399 --> 09:01.200
He's got nowhere to turn,

120
09:01.440 --> 09:03.559
so it's the perfect chance to rip him off.

121
09:03.759 --> 09:06.799
Bro, but Li Qiang isn't easy to mess with.

122
09:07.559 --> 09:09.360
What if we fail to play him,

123
09:09.480 --> 09:10.919
and he takes us out instead?

124
09:11.000 --> 09:12.320
Look at what a coward you are.

125
09:13.320 --> 09:14.200
What was it like before?

126
09:15.879 --> 09:18.279
No guns, no muscle.

127
09:19.080 --> 09:19.799
What about now?

128
09:21.960 --> 09:25.440
We've got both the men and the guns.

129
09:25.519 --> 09:27.240
What the hell are you afraid of?

130
09:28.799 --> 09:30.759
Every cop in the city is hunting him down.

131
09:31.360 --> 09:32.320
Dealing with him,

132
09:34.279 --> 09:35.679
I'm afraid we'll get burned.

133
09:35.919 --> 09:37.440
I think we've got to be extra careful.

134
09:40.120 --> 09:41.080
Fair point.

135
10:16.240 --> 10:17.120
No wonder.

136
10:17.799 --> 10:20.799
Boss Liang sounded so arrogant on the phone.

137
10:21.000 --> 10:22.279
Turns out you brought backup.

138
10:24.200 --> 10:25.240
You're kidding, Brother Qiang.

139
10:25.960 --> 10:27.960
I, Liang Wenbiao, don't have many virtues,

140
10:27.960 --> 10:29.039
but I love making friends.

141
10:29.200 --> 10:31.360
I've always seen you as a friend too, Brother Qiang.

142
10:32.240 --> 10:33.080
But I know

143
10:33.080 --> 10:36.720
you have no time to talk feelings right now.

144
10:37.440 --> 10:38.440
Let's get straight to money.

145
10:43.600 --> 10:45.360
Twenty kilograms of Psychedelic Blues,

146
10:45.519 --> 10:46.639
ten kilograms of No. 4.

147
10:49.679 --> 10:50.519
Are you in or not?

148
10:51.559 --> 10:52.480
That's quite a haul.

149
10:54.080 --> 10:55.480
But in Nanhai, it seems

150
10:56.399 --> 10:57.919
very few people can take that much.

151
11:01.919 --> 11:03.480
How many venues do you run?

152
11:03.639 --> 11:04.799
You don't need me to tell you that.

153
11:06.960 --> 11:08.039
I get what you mean.

154
11:09.120 --> 11:09.879
How about this:

155
11:10.480 --> 11:12.320
if you take all the goods at once,

156
11:13.840 --> 11:15.120
I'll give you a ten-percent cut of the profit.

157
11:19.759 --> 11:21.159
Everyone wants to make money.

158
11:21.679 --> 11:24.480
But you're in the spotlight in Nanhai, Brother Qiang.

159
11:24.639 --> 11:26.879
Doing business with you is too risky.

160
11:27.440 --> 11:29.480
Just for a ten-percent discount,

161
11:30.039 --> 11:31.240
taking such a massive risk...

162
11:32.679 --> 11:34.039
I don't think it's worth it.

163
11:34.480 --> 11:35.399
You're pushing your luck—

164
11:37.399 --> 11:37.919
What are you doing?

165
11:38.960 --> 11:39.639
Want to shoot?

166
11:40.240 --> 11:41.279
Then let's die together!

167
11:41.960 --> 11:42.480
Put it down.

168
11:43.360 --> 11:43.720
Put it down!

169
11:51.600 --> 11:53.200
My boy has quite a temper.

170
11:53.720 --> 11:54.639
I'll keep him in line.

171
11:56.480 --> 11:58.080
We came here today to talk business.

172
11:58.679 --> 12:00.519
Boss Liang, with the terms I offered,

173
12:00.720 --> 12:02.759
I don't see any reason for you to refuse.

174
12:06.840 --> 12:08.559
Normally, there wouldn't be any.

175
12:10.159 --> 12:11.559
But things are different now.

176
12:12.159 --> 12:13.399
You're in a hurry to flee,

177
12:13.919 --> 12:15.240
desperate to offload your goods.

178
12:17.399 --> 12:18.159
As for me?

179
12:20.080 --> 12:21.039
I have my suppliers.

180
12:23.159 --> 12:24.840
I don't have to make this deal.

181
12:26.679 --> 12:28.360
Since I have such an advantage,

182
12:29.080 --> 12:30.159
tell me, Brother Qiang,

183
12:31.000 --> 12:33.960
shouldn't I push my advantage?

184
12:43.240 --> 12:44.279
Push your advantage,

185
12:45.399 --> 12:46.840
or quit while you're ahead?

186
12:47.159 --> 12:48.480
You'd better think this through.

187
12:49.559 --> 12:51.399
You think because the cops are after us,

188
12:52.759 --> 12:54.440
you can kick us while we're down?

189
12:55.200 --> 12:55.799
Don't forget,

190
12:57.080 --> 12:59.320
we're in the same boat.

191
13:00.559 --> 13:01.799
If we go down,

192
13:02.559 --> 13:04.600
you could very well be next.

193
13:21.200 --> 13:22.320
Have you lost your mind?

194
13:22.519 --> 13:23.720
I just want to see

195
13:24.360 --> 13:26.120
if your boys will shoot.

196
13:43.279 --> 13:44.320
What's your name?

197
13:55.159 --> 13:56.039
Not bad.

198
13:56.759 --> 13:57.480
Pretty tough.

199
14:04.039 --> 14:05.519
Things are a bit tense, aren't they?

200
14:06.840 --> 14:08.440
Are we doing business or not?

201
14:14.919 --> 14:15.639
20 percent.

202
14:48.519 --> 14:49.720
Here's the shipment from Mr. Jiang.

203
14:50.200 --> 14:50.559
Thank you.

204
15:03.000 --> 15:03.519
Boss,

205
15:06.879 --> 15:08.440
I've already found a freight company for you.

206
15:09.200 --> 15:10.960
This afternoon, we'll go to the processing plant

207
15:11.279 --> 15:12.840
and hide the goods inside some timber.

208
15:13.159 --> 15:14.240
We'll set off tonight.

209
15:14.600 --> 15:15.720
In less than 30 hours,

210
15:15.960 --> 15:16.960
we can reach Jiangyang.

211
15:18.879 --> 15:19.240
Good.

212
15:29.559 --> 15:30.840
Boss, Brother Qiang is on the line.

213
15:35.440 --> 15:35.919
Boss.

214
15:37.120 --> 15:38.879
How are things going on your end?

215
15:39.200 --> 15:41.200
Right now, the only one who can take that much product

216
15:41.360 --> 15:42.159
is Liang Wenbiao.

217
15:43.519 --> 15:44.440
But he wants a 20 percent cut.

218
15:45.159 --> 15:47.000
Not sure if Chen Hai will have an issue with that.

219
15:48.960 --> 15:52.360
The Nanhai police are after you right now.

220
15:52.679 --> 15:54.120
You can't get away while holding the goods.

221
15:54.799 --> 15:56.679
Either way, unload the goods first.

222
15:57.200 --> 16:00.559
Also, don't route the payment through Chen Hai.

223
16:01.240 --> 16:02.840
Have Liang Wenbiao pay you in cash.

224
16:03.440 --> 16:04.519
Or have him wire the money

225
16:04.879 --> 16:06.840
to your sister-in-law's overseas account.

226
16:07.440 --> 16:08.159
If we do that,

227
16:08.960 --> 16:10.559
won't Pi Yazi turn on us?

228
16:12.600 --> 16:15.039
We've messed up twice in Nanhai.

229
16:15.919 --> 16:17.000
Even if he doesn't turn on me,

230
16:17.519 --> 16:19.200
I'm going to settle scores with him anyway.

231
16:20.159 --> 16:21.440
I'll handle this matter.

232
16:21.559 --> 16:22.559
Don't worry about it.

233
16:22.759 --> 16:23.559
What matters most right now

234
16:23.759 --> 16:27.200
is for you to get out of Nanhai safely.

235
16:27.639 --> 16:27.960
All right.

236
16:28.759 --> 16:29.759
We'll do it your way.

237
16:30.759 --> 16:31.240
And one more thing.

238
16:32.519 --> 16:33.919
Tell Liang Wenbiao

239
16:34.919 --> 16:36.399
that for any future shipments,

240
16:36.639 --> 16:39.399
my prices will be ten percent lower than the others.

241
16:39.919 --> 16:42.120
I'm heading back to Jiangyang tonight.

242
16:42.799 --> 16:44.360
Lao Qin will be waiting for you in Country M.

243
16:44.399 --> 16:45.919
Stay safe on the road.

244
16:46.320 --> 16:46.759
Got it.

245
16:55.200 --> 16:56.200
My boss said

246
16:56.519 --> 16:57.320
you can have your 20 percent cut,

247
16:57.960 --> 16:59.279
as our introductory gift.

248
16:59.679 --> 17:01.399
Whenever you take goods from us in the future,

249
17:02.480 --> 17:03.840
you'll make an extra ten percent.

250
17:08.000 --> 17:09.400
Pleasure doing business with you.

251
17:34.720 --> 17:35.319
Li Liping

252
17:35.519 --> 17:37.519
works as a teacher at Chenguang Kindergarten.

253
17:38.160 --> 17:39.519
According to our past files,

254
17:39.759 --> 17:41.200
regarding Qian Feng's drug deals,

255
17:41.440 --> 17:42.359
she's likely in the dark.

256
17:42.920 --> 17:44.160
However, what we don't know is

257
17:44.960 --> 17:47.000
whether she knows about his criminal activities.

258
17:48.279 --> 17:50.079
Ever since Li Liping divorced Qian Feng,

259
17:50.240 --> 17:51.640
she has been raising the child alone.

260
17:52.039 --> 17:53.079
Their daughter, Qian Shu,

261
17:53.279 --> 17:55.160
attends third grade at Chipiankou Primary School.

262
17:55.480 --> 17:58.680
When does Qian Shu usually go home?

263
17:59.200 --> 18:01.519
Usually, after school on Friday,

264
18:02.440 --> 18:03.920
Li Liping comes to pick her up.

265
18:04.359 --> 18:06.119
Qian Feng usually arrives Saturday afternoon

266
18:06.119 --> 18:07.519
in Yangchuan to meet the mother and daughter.

267
18:08.119 --> 18:09.680
Still, in case he shows up early,

268
18:09.920 --> 18:11.240
at Chipiankou Primary School

269
18:11.240 --> 18:12.480
and near Li Liping's home,

270
18:12.680 --> 18:13.920
we've stationed officers on stakeout.

271
18:20.799 --> 18:23.160
And the officers staked out at the school,

272
18:23.240 --> 18:24.000
how many are there?

273
18:24.400 --> 18:25.440
Based on our investigation,

274
18:25.839 --> 18:27.920
Qian Feng has never picked up his daughter at school.

275
18:28.119 --> 18:29.480
So we focused our main police force

276
18:29.480 --> 18:31.240
near Li Liping's home.

277
18:31.559 --> 18:33.319
Outside the school gate, there are only two officers.

278
18:33.759 --> 18:34.200
Of course,

279
18:34.319 --> 18:35.720
we also face practical limitations.

280
18:35.920 --> 18:37.079
We don't have enough manpower

281
18:37.079 --> 18:38.039
to dispatch any more officers.

282
18:38.519 --> 18:39.880
The primary mission of those two officers

283
18:40.039 --> 18:41.319
is strictly surveillance and tailing.

284
18:41.519 --> 18:42.880
The moment Qian Feng is spotted,

285
18:43.119 --> 18:44.440
they'll report back to us immediately.

286
18:44.759 --> 18:46.240
Our team will then immediately launch

287
18:46.400 --> 18:47.319
a full-scale arrest operation.

288
19:09.319 --> 19:11.400
We'll detour from Country L to Jiangyang.

289
19:11.400 --> 19:13.039
Although this route is a bit tougher,

290
19:13.400 --> 19:15.319
border control here is more relaxed.

291
19:16.279 --> 19:18.119
And the arrival time in Jiangyang is about the same.

292
19:20.160 --> 19:21.319
Once we get used to this route,

293
19:22.039 --> 19:23.119
business will be much easier.

294
19:23.400 --> 19:24.039
To be honest, Mr. Ma,

295
19:25.319 --> 19:26.680
moving goods out of Country M

296
19:26.680 --> 19:27.880
isn't really that hard.

297
19:28.240 --> 19:29.720
What worries me most right now

298
19:29.720 --> 19:30.759
is mainland China.

299
19:31.640 --> 19:34.319
Inspections are pretty tight over there now.

300
19:34.680 --> 19:36.759
But I know the domestic routes well.

301
19:37.039 --> 19:37.640
What's more,

302
19:37.680 --> 19:40.200
how the sales channels communicate—

303
19:40.359 --> 19:41.599
I know that inside out.

304
19:43.039 --> 19:44.240
The clients I have on hand

305
19:44.640 --> 19:46.039
can keep us going for two years.

306
19:47.519 --> 19:48.240
Don't worry.

307
19:49.200 --> 19:49.960
That's why I've always said

308
19:49.960 --> 19:51.599
you're no ordinary man, Mr. Ma.

309
19:51.759 --> 19:54.599
Otherwise, I wouldn't have chosen to work with you.

310
20:37.920 --> 20:38.599
Right here.

311
20:42.400 --> 20:43.279
This batch of timber

312
20:43.680 --> 20:45.079
was ordered from a company.

313
20:45.160 --> 20:46.759
All customs paperwork is legitimate

314
20:46.759 --> 20:47.839
and fully in order.

315
20:47.920 --> 20:50.440
Our shipment will be transported

316
20:50.440 --> 20:51.720
together with this timber to Jiangyang.

317
20:52.319 --> 20:54.880
There shouldn't be any issues.

318
20:55.200 --> 20:55.759
Mr. Qin,

319
20:56.440 --> 20:58.200
what is all this wood used for?

320
20:59.319 --> 21:00.319
It's used for indoor staircases.

321
21:01.000 --> 21:02.880
A lot of people made fortunes off it.

322
21:08.279 --> 21:10.079
The quality of this wood is really great.

323
21:11.440 --> 21:12.519
My dad was a carpenter.

324
21:13.039 --> 21:14.039
He always hoped

325
21:14.240 --> 21:15.920
that I'd become a carpenter too when I grew up.

326
21:18.519 --> 21:18.960
Brother,

327
21:19.720 --> 21:20.839
once I've made enough money,

328
21:21.200 --> 21:23.000
I'll open a furniture factory abroad

329
21:23.119 --> 21:24.880
to make custom pieces exclusively for the rich.

330
21:25.559 --> 21:26.079
Xiao Xiao,

331
21:26.640 --> 21:28.559
after you've made your fortune,

332
21:28.839 --> 21:30.559
haven't you thought of just enjoying life abroad?

333
21:32.039 --> 21:33.920
Following in his footsteps will fulfill his dream.

334
21:35.799 --> 21:36.119
Let's go.

335
21:54.640 --> 21:55.480
Old Ma, what do you think?

336
22:00.640 --> 22:01.839
It's a solid plan.

337
22:03.319 --> 22:04.640
I've already rented this place.

338
22:05.039 --> 22:06.880
It'll make moving our goods easy.

339
22:09.359 --> 22:09.640
Old Qin.

340
22:10.240 --> 22:12.000
The workers in this factory...

341
22:12.319 --> 22:12.880
are they reliable?

342
22:14.640 --> 22:16.480
Reliability doesn't matter with these people.

343
22:17.200 --> 22:17.799
As long as they get this,

344
22:18.359 --> 22:19.319
they won't say a word.

345
22:23.279 --> 22:24.599
Boss, the police are here!

346
22:25.039 --> 22:25.599
Go check it out, quick!

347
22:25.799 --> 22:26.319
Right away!

348
22:29.599 --> 22:30.680
I just rented this place.

349
22:30.680 --> 22:31.720
How do the cops already know?

350
22:48.039 --> 22:49.039
Boss, let's get out of here!

351
22:49.160 --> 22:50.039
If we don't leave now, we won't make it!

352
22:50.559 --> 22:53.359
No way. This shipment has to reach Jiangyang.

353
22:53.960 --> 22:55.440
Otherwise, your sister-in-law is dead.

354
23:04.599 --> 23:05.720
Lao Ma, hurry up!

355
23:05.839 --> 23:06.680
We're running out of time!

356
23:50.440 --> 23:51.720
Boss, hurry, let's go!

357
23:51.720 --> 23:52.200
Move.

358
24:03.319 --> 24:03.920
Let's go!

359
24:14.559 --> 24:15.160
Hurry, go!

360
24:15.839 --> 24:17.359
You're the only one who knows the buyer in Jiangyang.

361
24:17.519 --> 24:19.519
Sell the goods, take the cash, and save your sister-in-law.

362
24:19.559 --> 24:20.440
Brother!

363
24:20.680 --> 24:21.279
Just go!

364
24:21.680 --> 24:22.079
Go!

365
24:52.160 --> 24:53.000
I surrender!

366
25:02.759 --> 25:03.880
I—I surrender!

367
25:25.079 --> 25:26.759
You always pick this place to meet.

368
25:27.519 --> 25:29.759
Is the scenery here that great?

369
25:32.319 --> 25:33.359
The Nanhai police

370
25:33.359 --> 25:35.400
issued a citywide manhunt this afternoon.

371
25:36.279 --> 25:37.920
Did your men blow it?

372
25:38.839 --> 25:40.440
Didn't I already tell you?

373
25:41.000 --> 25:43.680
Your message was delivered to Qian Feng.

374
25:43.720 --> 25:45.079
What else are you worried about?

375
25:49.880 --> 25:51.359
I know what you're thinking.

376
25:51.880 --> 25:52.440
Relax.

377
25:53.079 --> 25:55.400
If the cops want to find my man,

378
25:55.960 --> 25:56.960
it won't be that easy.

379
25:58.160 --> 26:00.319
Once we deal with Qian Feng,

380
26:00.480 --> 26:03.359
things will blow over.

381
26:11.720 --> 26:12.839
Li Liping's home is just ahead.

382
26:12.960 --> 26:14.640
It'll take us about 15 minutes to get there.

383
26:15.200 --> 26:16.480
Qian Feng knows the police are looking for him.

384
26:16.880 --> 26:17.880
He'll be extra careful.

385
26:18.039 --> 26:19.079
He shouldn't be going home right now.

386
26:20.640 --> 26:21.720
Qian Feng loves his daughter dearly.

387
26:22.359 --> 26:23.480
Over the past three years,

388
26:23.680 --> 26:25.160
he visited her every weekend.

389
26:26.079 --> 26:27.079
Family ties are priceless, after all.

390
26:27.839 --> 26:29.839
So even while on the run,

391
26:30.240 --> 26:32.240
he'd make time to see Qian Shu.

392
26:32.440 --> 26:33.319
That's why I think

393
26:33.880 --> 26:34.640
at this time of day,

394
26:35.359 --> 26:36.480
it's unlikely he'll head home.

395
26:37.079 --> 26:38.319
He's more likely to go to school to see his daughter.

396
26:39.440 --> 26:40.000
I agree.

397
26:40.880 --> 26:42.160
Qian Feng is on the run.

398
26:42.559 --> 26:43.920
We can't rely on his usual habits

399
26:43.920 --> 26:45.400
to predict his next move.

400
26:45.880 --> 26:47.160
What if Qian Feng heads straight home?

401
26:47.920 --> 26:48.759
No one can say for sure right now.

402
26:49.640 --> 26:51.200
That's why we staked out both locations

403
26:51.640 --> 26:52.400
to cover all bases.

404
26:56.799 --> 26:58.599
Captain Lu sent over the suspect's composite sketch.

405
27:07.799 --> 27:08.359
That's him.

406
27:10.720 --> 27:11.359
How do you know?

407
27:11.960 --> 27:13.160
I ran into him on the train.

408
27:14.240 --> 27:15.680
He had a shooter's callus on his hand.

409
27:17.039 --> 27:17.599
Are you sure?

410
27:19.119 --> 27:19.480
Positive.

411
27:21.119 --> 27:21.720
So that means

412
27:21.920 --> 27:23.519
he arrived on the same train as us.

413
27:24.079 --> 27:25.799
Someone picked the suspect up when he got off.

414
27:26.119 --> 27:26.960
In that case,

415
27:27.559 --> 27:28.759
he isn't working alone this time.

416
27:30.279 --> 27:31.599
We've been wondering

417
27:31.839 --> 27:33.319
what this suspect's motive is.

418
27:34.160 --> 27:36.279
Ruling out helping Qian Feng flee or silencing him,

419
27:36.720 --> 27:38.759
what other possibility could there be?

420
27:40.319 --> 27:41.319
Here's the situation:

421
27:41.599 --> 27:42.880
Qian Feng's cover has been blown.

422
27:43.079 --> 27:45.240
If we were the drug cartel behind Qian Feng,

423
27:45.279 --> 27:47.279
why would we send this suspect out?

424
27:47.960 --> 27:50.000
The cartel has only one objective:

425
27:50.359 --> 27:52.839
prevent Qian Feng from giving the police

426
27:52.880 --> 27:54.000
any information about their higher-ups.

427
27:55.240 --> 27:56.400
This Qian Feng...

428
27:59.680 --> 28:01.160
he's hiding plenty of secrets.

429
28:01.759 --> 28:02.279
Qian Shu!

430
28:05.400 --> 28:06.759
I'll notify the officers over there right now.

431
28:57.839 --> 28:58.359
Mom!

432
29:01.240 --> 29:02.279
My dad is driving over.

433
29:02.279 --> 29:04.400
Why don't you ride with us?

434
29:04.440 --> 29:05.920
Yeah, let's go together.

435
29:05.920 --> 29:06.599
We can drop you off.

436
29:06.599 --> 29:07.240
No, that's okay.

437
29:07.240 --> 29:09.279
My mom will be here to pick me up soon.

438
29:09.440 --> 29:11.079
All right then, bye!

439
29:11.920 --> 29:12.599
Bye!

440
29:14.200 --> 29:15.400
Qian Shu has reached the school gate.

441
29:15.839 --> 29:17.200
Everyone, keep an eye out for the suspect.

442
29:18.759 --> 29:19.200
Goodbye.

443
29:19.400 --> 29:19.960
Bye.

444
29:21.960 --> 29:23.279
The suspect is very likely nearby.

445
29:24.079 --> 29:25.279
Have your team keep a close eye on Qian Shu.

446
29:25.599 --> 29:26.200
We're getting out.

447
30:56.000 --> 30:57.000
There's a man in sunglasses

448
30:57.039 --> 30:58.640
and a cap crossing the street.

449
30:58.960 --> 31:00.000
Ge Dan, go check it out.

450
31:00.440 --> 31:00.799
Copy that.

451
31:20.359 --> 31:21.519
Target confirmed as Qian Feng.

452
31:21.960 --> 31:23.680
All units, prepare to move in.

453
31:24.200 --> 31:24.599
Hold on.

454
31:26.039 --> 31:27.079
The suspect hasn't shown up yet.

455
31:27.400 --> 31:28.519
Tell your men to hold.

456
31:28.880 --> 31:29.440
Officer Zhuang,

457
31:30.160 --> 31:31.880
this is our best chance to take Qian Feng.

458
31:32.839 --> 31:34.440
The suspect might not have found him yet.

459
31:36.039 --> 31:38.000
Wait a bit longer. We might get both.

460
31:38.359 --> 31:38.640
All right.

461
31:43.519 --> 31:44.799
Has anyone seen Li Liping?

462
31:46.200 --> 31:47.319
Has anyone seen Li Liping?

463
31:47.839 --> 31:48.960
Report her location the moment you see her.

464
31:54.680 --> 31:55.119
Xiaoshu!

465
31:56.240 --> 31:56.839
Daddy!

466
31:59.400 --> 31:59.880
School's out?

467
32:00.880 --> 32:02.000
Daddy's picking you up today.

468
32:03.119 --> 32:04.559
But Mommy isn't here yet.

469
32:06.519 --> 32:07.440
You're a big girl now.

470
32:08.119 --> 32:09.200
Why do you always insist

471
32:09.200 --> 32:10.240
on having Mommy pick you up?

472
32:10.480 --> 32:11.400
I'm taking you home today.

473
32:11.599 --> 32:12.880
Let's wait for Mommy at home, okay?

474
32:13.559 --> 32:14.319
Didn't you say

475
32:14.319 --> 32:16.240
never to go home alone after school

476
32:16.279 --> 32:17.799
and wait for Mommy to pick me up?

477
32:19.160 --> 32:20.119
You were little back then.

478
32:20.880 --> 32:21.839
You're all grown up now.

479
32:22.079 --> 32:22.599
Be a good girl.

480
32:23.039 --> 32:24.359
Let's wait for Mommy at home, okay?

481
32:27.920 --> 32:29.160
Mommy's calling!

482
32:30.920 --> 32:31.559
Mommy!

483
32:32.480 --> 32:34.319
Yes, I'm with Daddy!

484
32:35.720 --> 32:36.480
Hold on.

485
32:41.319 --> 32:42.640
Mommy wants to talk to you.

486
32:46.480 --> 32:47.000
Liping?

487
32:48.559 --> 32:50.839
Qian Feng, take the kid and run!

488
32:51.039 --> 32:51.920
Qian Feng.

489
32:55.839 --> 32:56.640
Qian Feng.

490
32:57.039 --> 32:59.319
You weren't easy to track down.

491
33:02.000 --> 33:04.079
Looks like someone's watching Qian Feng.

492
33:04.440 --> 33:05.359
Everyone, hold your positions.

493
33:08.319 --> 33:08.920
What do you want?

494
33:10.319 --> 33:12.079
Whatever it is, take it out on me!

495
33:12.359 --> 33:14.240
If you lay a finger on my family...

496
33:14.519 --> 33:15.559
Don't get cocky.

497
33:15.559 --> 33:16.359
You think I won't

498
33:16.640 --> 33:19.240
have someone blow your wife's brains out right now?

499
33:24.559 --> 33:25.400
Come on.

500
33:26.640 --> 33:27.720
Look to your right.

501
33:33.200 --> 33:35.480
Right. Turn a little more.

502
33:41.759 --> 33:42.640
My wife has nothing to do with this!

503
33:43.000 --> 33:43.839
Let her go right now!

504
33:48.240 --> 33:49.160
To my front left.

505
33:49.400 --> 33:50.240
Suspect vehicle.

506
33:50.559 --> 33:52.839
Mercedes MPV, plate ends in 763.

507
33:53.440 --> 33:55.440
Listen to me carefully, Qian Feng.

508
33:55.920 --> 33:57.920
The police are watching you like hawks.

509
33:58.039 --> 33:59.440
You have no chance of escaping.

510
34:00.400 --> 34:02.839
Boss Chen has a message for you.

511
34:06.839 --> 34:07.759
What you need to do,

512
34:08.239 --> 34:09.719
I've already made very clear.

513
34:10.519 --> 34:11.840
As long as you do as you're told,

514
34:12.599 --> 34:15.559
the boss will take good care of your family.

515
34:15.880 --> 34:17.559
But if you dare say

516
34:17.559 --> 34:19.000
even a single word to the police,

517
34:21.159 --> 34:22.280
then get ready

518
34:23.239 --> 34:24.559
to collect your wife's corpse.

519
34:25.599 --> 34:25.960
No...

520
34:27.960 --> 34:29.599
ex-wife, rather.

521
34:30.880 --> 34:33.119
Then again, I hear

522
34:34.039 --> 34:35.559
you still love her very much.

523
34:36.840 --> 34:37.440
Right?

524
34:47.000 --> 34:47.880
Li Xiao, Ge Dan!

525
34:50.800 --> 34:52.239
Team A, arrest Qian Feng immediately!

526
34:52.239 --> 34:53.920
Team B, pursue the suspect vehicle with me!

527
34:55.039 --> 34:55.639
Liping!

528
34:57.440 --> 34:58.079
I want Daddy!

529
34:58.079 --> 34:59.119
They took my wife!

530
34:59.119 --> 35:00.599
Please, you have to save my wife!

531
35:00.599 --> 35:01.039
Daddy!

532
35:01.480 --> 35:02.599
Daddy's here. Don't be scared.

533
35:02.800 --> 35:03.679
Liping!

534
35:03.679 --> 35:04.440
Daddy's here. Don't be scared.

535
35:47.440 --> 35:47.880
Get out of the car.

536
35:48.639 --> 35:49.119
Ram through.

537
36:04.320 --> 36:04.760
Drive.

538
36:11.199 --> 36:11.719
Are you okay?

539
36:11.760 --> 36:12.039
I'm fine.

540
36:12.239 --> 36:13.159
Get in.

541
38:29.360 --> 38:30.639
Center of the square, 11 o'clock, moving north.

542
38:30.639 --> 38:31.159
Suspect spotted.

543
38:31.159 --> 38:31.800
Prepare to move in.

544
38:48.480 --> 38:50.119
Out of the way! Move!

545
38:51.559 --> 38:52.159
Out of the way!

546
38:52.400 --> 38:52.840
Freeze!

547
38:59.239 --> 38:59.800
Stop!

548
39:05.800 --> 39:06.840
Stop right there! Stop!

549
39:07.239 --> 39:07.880
Don't run!

550
39:13.880 --> 39:14.400
Move!

551
39:15.840 --> 39:17.360
Freeze! Stop! Don't run!

552
39:31.000 --> 39:31.559
Zhuang Yan!

553
39:32.280 --> 39:32.679
After him!

554
39:42.159 --> 39:43.000
Psycho.

555
39:43.079 --> 39:44.159
Are you crazy?!

556
40:48.760 --> 40:50.840
Brother Si, I've passed along the boss's message.

557
40:58.920 --> 40:59.400
Keep driving.

558
41:02.639 --> 41:03.480
You're not a taxi driver.

559
41:03.960 --> 41:04.760
Are you in the military?

560
41:10.920 --> 41:11.599
So it's you.

561
41:15.960 --> 41:16.360
Wait, no.

562
41:35.039 --> 41:36.800
Police! I'm commandeering your car.

563
41:38.199 --> 41:38.760
So that means

564
41:39.599 --> 41:40.960
you were never an army medic either.

565
41:40.960 --> 41:41.920
Cut the crap.

566
41:42.280 --> 41:43.119
Put your hands in front.

567
41:49.119 --> 41:49.400
Where's the gun?

568
42:08.159 --> 42:09.559
What's that? Take it out yourself.

569
42:13.320 --> 42:14.159
Don't try any tricks.

570
42:19.239 --> 42:20.239
It's 52 percent.

571
42:21.199 --> 42:21.840
Want a sip?

572
42:22.400 --> 42:23.280
Cut the crap.

573
42:30.079 --> 42:30.519
Move it.

574
42:33.840 --> 42:34.239
Left hand.

575
42:39.480 --> 42:40.280
Cuff it to the car door.

576
42:58.480 --> 42:59.119
Let go of me!

577
42:59.119 --> 42:59.559
Don't move!

578
42:59.880 --> 43:00.199
Zhuang Yan.

579
43:02.840 --> 43:03.360
Take him away.

580
43:04.400 --> 43:04.880
Are you okay?

581
43:10.199 --> 43:10.599
Li Xiao.

582
43:13.519 --> 43:13.960
Hello?

583
43:14.079 --> 43:14.639
Hello?

584
43:15.039 --> 43:15.440
Old Zhuang.

585
43:16.679 --> 43:17.320
I caught one here.

586
43:17.320 --> 43:17.920
Where are you guys?

587
43:18.159 --> 43:19.000
We're still at the square.

588
43:19.039 --> 43:19.719
Caught one here too.

589
43:21.119 --> 43:22.559
Want us to come over to you?

590
43:22.639 --> 43:24.079
No need. I'll come meet up with you.

591
43:26.760 --> 43:28.079
Are you okay? Are you hurt?

592
43:32.039 --> 43:32.440
It hurts.

593
43:35.840 --> 43:36.199
It's okay.

594
43:44.960 --> 43:45.960
Don't even think about running.

595
43:46.480 --> 43:47.280
If you try to run,

596
43:48.119 --> 43:49.000
I'll shoot you dead.
